# Production environment variables

Copy into Hatchbox (or your host) as needed. Never commit real secrets.

```bash
# Required
RAILS_MASTER_KEY=
APP_HOST=https://yourdomain.com
DATABASE_URL=postgres://USER:PASS@HOST:5432/DBNAME

# Email (Resend)
RESEND_API_KEY=
MAIL_FROM=Folio <hello@yourdomain.com>

# Active Storage → Cloudflare R2
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=
R2_ENDPOINT=https://ACCOUNT_ID.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
# R2_REGION=auto

# AI (OpenAI)
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Optional
# INERTIA_SSR=1
# INERTIA_SSR_URL=http://localhost:13714
# SOLID_QUEUE_IN_PUMA=1   # only if you do NOT run a separate bin/jobs process
# RAILS_LOG_LEVEL=info
```

See `docs/deployment.md` and `docs/hatchbox-deployment-guide.md`.
